#### 3.3.5 Ego status supervision.

The world status representation SworldS\_{\text{world}} contains both scene tokens and ego status embeddings. During world model prediction, ego status guides the evolution of scene representations as well as itself. Therefore, accurate prediction of ego status is crucial for modeling world dynamics. To provide precise guidance for the transition of world state, we introduce ego status supervision built upon the self-supervised future status prediction.

